          "text": " Baryanaga efeeza zaabo omu mihanda, n'ezaabu zaabo tiziribaasa kubajuna aha izooba ry'ekiniga kya MUKAMA. Tiziribamara njara, kandi tiziribaigutsa; ahabw'okuba ezo nizo zaababeereire ekirikuteeza entsibo, ekyabareeteire okutahikiirira. ",
